          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A
            %strong double complex
            or
            %strong bicomplex
            is a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagram"} diagram
            of shape
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
